YttriumInfo: "Your world bursts with Yttrium!"
UraniumInfo: "Your world bursts with Uranium!"
TechneciumInfo: "Your world bursts with Technecium!"
downedEquinoxInfo: "The gift of the celestials sparkle in the atmosphere..."
StarIdolInfo: "There are plenty of stars in the sky, child."
downedMoonlordInfo1: "The Ancients have Awakened!"
downedMoonlordInfo2: "The Essence of the Moon Lord sparkles in the caves below..."
downedMechBossAnyInfo: "The caves shine with light for a brief moment..."
downedSistersInfo: "Chaotic energy grows in the deepest parts of the world."
downedBoss2Info: "You hear a hum of harmony from the Terrarium after the defeat of a great demon..."
downedBoss3Info1: "Bones of the ancient past burst with energy!"
downedBoss3Info2: "The desert winds stir..."
downedBoss3Info3: "The winter hills rumble..."
downedPlantBossInfo1: "The choirs of unity hum from the terrarium."
downedPlantBossInfo2: "The withered machines of the emptiness reactivate."
downedPlantBossInfo3: "Devils in the underworld begin to plot."
downedPlantBossInfo4: "Hey kid, it's me, Anubis. Do me a favor and meet me back in town, I wanna talk to ya about somethin'."
downedStormAnyInfo: "The clap of a thunderbolt roars in the caverns..."
hardModeInfo: "The Souls of Fury and Wrath are unleashed upon the world!"
downedAllAncientsInfo: "Chaos begins to stir in the atmosphere..."